#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013 |title=The Electric Vehicle|author=Gijs Mom |page= |ISBN=|passage=After that, the CGV "denumbered" a total of sixty '''taxicabs''', that is, it removed them from the register of stationing '''taxicabs'''. The end of the CGV experiment is controversial, but it is certain that the behavior of the drivers (who, as we saw, were not directly salaried by CGV) was an important incentive to the denumbering of cabs: because of the high ''moyenne'', they refused to accept customers for short trips and only accepted orders by the day or half-day.}}

